## Index of the command library. Nothing here to import: this names which module holds which upstream file.
##
## Upstream runs two systems side by side: brigadier (`node/`, `context/`, `argument_builder.rs`, `argument_types/`)
## and the older tree (`tree/`, `args/`, `dispatcher.rs`), which the first falls back to on an unknown command.
##
## - cmderrors.aowl: errors/*
## - string_range.aowl: context/string_range.rs
## - string_reader.aowl: string_reader.rs
## - suggestion.aowl: suggestion/mod.rs, suggestion/suggestions.rs
## - cmdsource.aowl: mod.rs, context/command_source.rs, and the hooks for Server, World, Player and EntityBase
## - cmdtree.aowl: node/mod.rs, node/attached.rs, node/detached.rs, node/tree.rs, context/command_context.rs,
##   argument_types/argument_type.rs, suggestion/provider.rs
## - argument_builder.aowl: argument_builder.rs
## - argtype.aowl: argument_types/core/*
## - coordinates.aowl: argument_types/coordinates/*
## - entity_selector.aowl: argument_types/entity_selector/*, argument_types/entity.rs, argument_types/mod.rs,
##   argument_types/range.rs
## - cmddispatch.aowl: node/dispatcher.rs
## - fallbackdispatch.aowl: dispatcher.rs, tree/*, args/mod.rs
## - args.aowl: the legacy consumers in args/ ported so far
## - client_suggestions.aowl: client_suggestions.rs
##
## The commands themselves are in src/server/command. `grep -rn PARTIAL src/command src/server/command` lists what is
## not whole, and `python tools/port_status.py --missing pumpkin` what has not been started.
